// counts, sum per-model token buckets, max(sessions). This handles
// the multi-computer case — Computer A and Computer B with the same
// userKey push to the same usage/<userKey>.json; without merging,
// the second push overwrites the first. With merging, both
// computers' day-rows combine into one.
// 2026-05-18 v25.

